"Sakura Aoyama, about eighteen and unable to write, is an Iron March spy."
"Sakura posed as the dead noble girl Mei Shuyin to reach the Verdant capital."
"Sakura's rare Class lets her change how her status screen looks to others in fine detail."
"Sakura may be a transmigrator; the Empire's binder points to world fifteen or nineteen."
"Sakura was abused and forced into her work, and the High Regent means to turn her to the Empire."
"Two of the Nameless Hell Hound's brothers, the twins Ben and Jerry, are penned in the Scorched Steeps."
"The Steeps' chief wants rid of one troublesome twin, as Valrok warned the pair would be untamable."
"The Nameless Hell Hound's mother was sent to the fighting pits and is believed dead."
